+# Notes from your asks
+
+Rules, preferences and ideas you said about this module that are not work, one line each, with a link to your words. Written by `node Server/UndoneToTasks.mjs --notes --apply` from the sort pass over the undone asks ([crack 2](/framework/core/Task/doc/cracks.md)).
+
+- Replies recap the last few messages as what was asked and what is being done, structured to scan. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/87bec773-d6dd-421c-92cc-fdd8a9eb5103/?tab=coverage#p11044), 2026-10-12)
+- Keep lookups into past work brief so the working context is not polluted. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/87bec773-d6dd-421c-92cc-fdd8a9eb5103/?tab=coverage#p10902), 2026-10-12)
+- Write everything down where it belongs, and keep an eye on usage against the clock. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/87bec773-d6dd-421c-92cc-fdd8a9eb5103/?tab=coverage#p10902), 2026-10-12)
+- Two systems that hold similar but different data are one system: consolidate them, never keep both. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/87bec773-d6dd-421c-92cc-fdd8a9eb5103/?tab=coverage#p10769), 2026-10-12)
+- Feedback goes on the board or the page, never only in the chat. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p2665), 2026-10-13)
+- Anything waiting on the owner belongs in the document or design itself. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p2665), 2026-10-13)
