+# Notes from your asks
+
+Rules, preferences and ideas you said about this module that are not work, one line each, with a link to your words. Written by `node Server/UndoneToTasks.mjs --notes --apply` from the sort pass over the undone asks ([crack 2](/framework/core/Task/doc/cracks.md)).
+
+- The 80/20 and 90/10 usage ratios are a rough guide, not a benchmark to hit. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/87bec773-d6dd-421c-92cc-fdd8a9eb5103/?tab=coverage#p11077), 2026-10-12)
+- Spend about 70 to 90 percent of the weekly pace, and never reach 100 percent. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p1652), 2026-10-13)
+- Token use aims at 70 to 90 percent of the weekly pace and stays under the pace limit. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p4177), 2026-10-13)
+- Work on its own while keeping an eye on usage pace as it goes. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p1251), 2026-10-13)
+- Keep an eye on the token count while work runs, alongside the pace rule. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p1251), 2026-10-13)
+- Minions keep spawning while the used share of a usage window stays at or under the elapsed share. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p647), 2026-10-12)
+- Pace token use so the rest of the window's budget is spent evenly over the time left, not in a rush at the end. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/730e8a7b-4cbf-4d09-90bd-d61d2bf9384a/?tab=coverage#p34), 2026-10-13)
+- Aim to use about 95% of the weekly limit by the end of the weekly window, paced against the clock. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/730e8a7b-4cbf-4d09-90bd-d61d2bf9384a/?tab=coverage#p34), 2026-10-13)
+- Work is launched early in a usage window so the unused share is spent before the reset. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p6258), 2026-10-14)
+- Batches that a usage reset would cancel or restart are not launched, because they spend next week's tokens. ([your words](/framework/ai/sessions/f155ecbd-2911-4f55-bc4c-c1cf9d7b7026/?tab=coverage#p6258), 2026-10-14)
